    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_4",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Your coordination left much to be desired.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_5",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I was impressed by how smoothly you passed the bowl.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_6",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I regret the time we lost during your last trip.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_7",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Finishing those orders so early deserves recognition.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_8",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The timing of that pickup could not have been better.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_9",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Your decision to walk away cost us dearly.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_10",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I disapprove of the way you handled the queue.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_11",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "That whole round was a delight to watch.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_12",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "You surpassed yourself on the final delivery.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_13",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Our teamwork this round was second to none.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_14",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "That performance was below par.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_15",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The effort you put into keeping the aisle clear paid off.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_16",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "You let us down with that unnecessary stop.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_17",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Picking up that spare dish turned out wonderfully.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_18",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The delivery you just completed was flawless.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_19",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "You reacted admirably when I got stuck.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_20",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "You managed the crowded corner expertly.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_21",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "We could hardly have asked for a worse handoff.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_22",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The careless way you left that onion was frustrating.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_23",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "What you did with the last bowl was commendable.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_24",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I am proud of the progress you made during that round.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_25",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Your last turn showed remarkably sound judgment.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_26",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I cannot fault your work on that final order.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_27",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I am not pleased with how long you stood there.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_28",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "That pickup was nothing to write home about.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "trajectory",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_trajectory_29",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "A clear work surface makes this kitchen a pleasure to use.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_0",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The short path to the hatch is a real asset.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_1",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I value easy access to the dish supply.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_2",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "There is little merit in this cramped arrangement.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_3",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The corner nearest the stove is particularly troublesome.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_4",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "A second place to put bowls would be a blessing.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_5",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The wide gap between these worktops is convenient.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_6",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "This storage arrangement leaves me cold.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_7",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The design of the serving station deserves praise.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_8",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I have a low opinion of the far cooking station.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_9",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Keeping ingredients within reach is beneficial.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_10",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "This route strikes me as needlessly complicated.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_11",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The separate lane for deliveries is a welcome feature.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_12",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The lack of counter space is a nuisance.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_13",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "A long wait for a bowl is unacceptable.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_14",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The central stove has an advantage over the distant one.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_15",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The kitchen feels much too cluttered for my liking.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_16",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I appreciate the extra room beside the serving window.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_17",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "The distance between the onion supply and the pot is excessive.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_18",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I am fond of the little workspace on the upper side.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "feature",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_feature_19",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "You would have done better to collect a bowl instead.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_action_0",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Taking the lower aisle instead would have saved valuable time.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_action_1",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "You should have delivered that soup instead of waiting.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_action_2",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "It would have been wiser to step aside rather than block me.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_action_3",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Fetching another onion instead would have been the superior choice.",
    "speech_act": "evaluative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_evaluative_action_4",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Bring over whichever dish is nearest to you.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_0",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Get rid of the ingredient you are holding.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_1",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Carry on filling the pot until it has three ingredients.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_2",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Let the other cook go through ahead of you.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_3",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Put down what you have and come toward me.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_4",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "See to it that the soup reaches the hatch.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_5",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Would you mind passing that onion over here?",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_6",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Could I ask you to stay beside the empty stove?",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_7",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I need you to return the spare bowl to the bench.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_8",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Make sure to collect the tomato from the lower supply.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_9",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Leave enough room for me to get past.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_10",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Give me the plate after you finish that delivery.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_11",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Hold on to the onion for now.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_12",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Turn back before you enter the narrow passage.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_13",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Try going around the stove on its other side.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_14",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Be careful to keep that hot soup in your hands.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_15",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Do not let go of the bowl yet.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_16",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Please refrain from picking up another tomato.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_17",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "I would like you to take over at this pot.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_18",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Please go as far as the worktop beside the door.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_19",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Continue walking until you reach the dish rack.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_20",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Help me by bringing the final ingredient.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_21",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Get back to the serving area as soon as you can.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_22",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Step out of the space between me and the stove.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_23",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Pass along the empty bowl rather than keeping it.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_24",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Finish the delivery before collecting anything else.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_25",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "How about fetching a fresh dish for me?",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_26",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "Would you be able to wait at the upper counter?",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_27",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
  },
  {
    "text": "You had better move that onion into the pot.",
    "speech_act": "imperative",
    "grounding": "action",
    "group_id": "root_authored_imperative_action_28",
    "source": "new_synthetic_seed_v3",
    "human_data": false
